project OPERATIONS:
  version 1
  title "M1-M4 operations implementation plan"
  description |
    Detailed plan for formatter preview, structural-edit previews, safe write, advance, and the project-metadata CLI.
    Points express relative size. On 2026-07-22, mutation Core 7p, FORMAT_APPLICATION 1p, MUTATION_CLI_PREVIEW 2p, FORMAT_CLI_PREVIEW 2p, SAFE_WRITE_ADAPTER 4p, SAFE_WRITE_ACCEPTANCE 2p, ADVANCE_PLANNER 4p, and ADVANCE_CLI_ACCEPTANCE 2p completed for 24p over one active day.
    PROJECT_METADATA_CLI 5p completed on 2026-07-23, recalibrating measured velocity to 29p/2d from the cumulative 29p over two active days.
    The M3 start thresholds for recommendation and the AI Agent Guidance Registry are closed. Recommendation completed through the MVP public alpha; the AI Agent Guidance Registry was added as an independent detail plan and a beta-gate macro work package. Multi-plan composition remains a future post-beta backlog.
  as_of 2026-07-23
  duration_unit point
  velocity 29p/2d
  finish PROJECT_METADATA_CLI_READY

resource DEVELOPERS:
  title "Implementation capacity"
  capacity 2

resource REVIEWERS:
  title "Interface and safety review capacity"
  description "Only one acceptance decision for the public CLI contract or write safety runs at a time"
  capacity 1

resource CLI_SURFACE:
  title "CLI public-surface ownership"
  description "Avoid concurrent changes to the current src/cli.ts, src/index.ts, and CLI and help tests"
  capacity 1

resource FILESYSTEM_WRITE:
  title "Filesystem write-path ownership"
  description "Avoid concurrent changes to digests, temporary files, fsync, and atomic rename"
  capacity 1

milestone NOW:
  title "Operations roadmap defined"
  state reached

milestone FORMAT_APPLICATION_READY:
  title "Formatter application service complete"

milestone FORMAT_PREVIEW_READY:
  title "DSL format preview accepted"

milestone TASK_MUTATION_READY:
  title "Task-mutation Core complete"

milestone ENTITY_MUTATION_READY:
  title "Milestone and resource mutation Core complete"

milestone MUTATION_PREVIEW_READY:
  title "Structural-edit preview accepted"

milestone EDIT_PREVIEW_READY:
  title "M2 safe editing previews complete"

milestone WRITE_ADAPTER_READY:
  title "Safe-write adapter complete"

milestone SAFE_WRITE_READY:
  title "M3 safe write accepted"

milestone ADVANCE_PLANNER_READY:
  title "Advance planner complete"

milestone OPERATIONS_READY:
  title "M4 advance accepted"

task FORMAT_APPLICATION NOW -> FORMAT_APPLICATION_READY:
  title "Project formatter candidates into preview results"
  description |
    Create: src/application/format.ts.
    Reuse: src/formatter/source-formatter.ts and src/editing/unified-diff.ts from TASK_MUTATION_CORE. Do not add I/O or writes.
    Accept: Obtain candidate, changed, UTF-16 TextEdit, unified diff, and check outcome from the revalidated result.
    Test: npm run build && node --test test/formatter.test.mjs.
    Parallel: Do not share owned files with TASK_MUTATION_CORE.
  duration 1p
  status done
  priority 90
  requires:
    DEVELOPERS 1

task FORMAT_CLI_PREVIEW FORMAT_APPLICATION_READY -> FORMAT_PREVIEW_READY:
  title "Publish the DSL format preview command"
  description |
    Modify: src/cli.ts, src/index.ts, test/cli.test.mjs, and test/e2e.test.mjs.
    Accept: Publish the default candidate, --diff, --check, text and JSON, and stdin; continue to reject --write and --out.
    Test: npm run build && node --test test/formatter.test.mjs test/cli.test.mjs test/e2e.test.mjs.
    Parallel: This can run with mutation Core, but CLI_SURFACE serializes it with other public CLI tasks.
  duration 2p
  status done
  priority 90
  requires:
    DEVELOPERS 1
    REVIEWERS 1
    CLI_SURFACE 1

task TASK_MUTATION_CORE NOW -> TASK_MUTATION_READY:
  title "Implement task mutations as local TextEdits"
  description |
    Create: docs/specs/mutation.md, src/mutation/types.ts, src/mutation/text-edits.ts, src/mutation/task.ts, src/application/mutate.ts, src/editing/unified-diff.ts, and test/mutation.test.mjs.
    Accept: task add/set/remove/finish resolves exactly one target and returns non-overlapping UTF-16 TextEdits and a revalidated candidate. Perform no I/O.
    Test: npm run build && node --test test/mutation.test.mjs.
    Parallel: Do not share owned files with FORMAT_APPLICATION.
  duration 4p
  status done
  priority 100
  requires:
    DEVELOPERS 1

task ENTITY_MUTATION_CORE TASK_MUTATION_READY -> ENTITY_MUTATION_READY:
  title "Implement milestone and resource mutations"
  description |
    Create: src/mutation/milestone.ts, src/mutation/resource.ts, src/mutation/source.ts, src/mutation/entity-editor.ts, and src/mutation/diagnostics.ts.
    Modify: src/mutation/types.ts, src/application/mutate.ts, and test/mutation.test.mjs.
    Accept: milestone/resource add/set/remove preserves declaration order, comments, and unrelated fields without an implicit cascade. Validate connected milestones and resource requirements in the final atomic-batch candidate.
    Test: npm run build && node --test test/mutation.test.mjs.
    Parallel: This can run with the formatter branch but follows TASK_MUTATION_CORE because it reuses the shared task-mutation planner.
  duration 3p
  status done
  priority 100
  requires:
    DEVELOPERS 1

task MUTATION_CLI_PREVIEW ENTITY_MUTATION_READY -> MUTATION_PREVIEW_READY:
  title "Publish structural-edit preview commands"
  description |
    Modify: src/cli.ts, src/index.ts, test/cli.test.mjs, and test/e2e.test.mjs.
    Accept: Publish default previews and --diff for task, milestone, and resource commands in text and JSON; continue to reject --write and --out.
    Test: npm run build && node --test test/mutation.test.mjs test/cli.test.mjs test/e2e.test.mjs.
    Parallel: CLI_SURFACE and REVIEWERS serialize this with FORMAT_CLI_PREVIEW.
  duration 2p
  status done
  priority 100
  requires:
    DEVELOPERS 1
    REVIEWERS 1
    CLI_SURFACE 1

gate FORMAT_PREVIEW_GATE FORMAT_PREVIEW_READY -> EDIT_PREVIEW_READY:
  reason "M2 requires formatter-preview acceptance"

gate MUTATION_PREVIEW_GATE MUTATION_PREVIEW_READY -> EDIT_PREVIEW_READY:
  reason "M2 requires structural-edit preview acceptance"

task SAFE_WRITE_ADAPTER EDIT_PREVIEW_READY -> WRITE_ADAPTER_READY:
  title "Implement the digest check and atomic-write adapter"
  description |
    Create: src/io/document-file.ts, src/io/safe-write.ts, and test/write-safety.test.mjs.
    Refactor: Share the existing raw-byte SHA-256 read in src/cli.ts.
    Accept: Reject symlinks; recheck the expected digest; use a same-directory temporary file, flush/fsync, atomic rename, and parent-directory fsync; then recheck after rename.
    Test: npm run build && node --test test/write-safety.test.mjs test/cli.test.mjs.
    Parallel: FILESYSTEM_WRITE exclusively owns the filesystem write path.
  duration 4p
  status done
  priority 100
  requires:
    DEVELOPERS 1
    REVIEWERS 1
    CLI_SURFACE 1
    FILESYSTEM_WRITE 1

task SAFE_WRITE_ACCEPTANCE WRITE_ADAPTER_READY -> SAFE_WRITE_READY:
  title "Accept the safe-write gate for every editing command"
  description |
    Modify: src/cli.ts, test/e2e.test.mjs, and test/self-use.test.mjs.
    Accept: Verify --write, --out, and --expect-digest for dsl format and every mutation; race rejection; preservation of the original on failure; and a temporary-copy round trip of the grammar plan.
    Test: npm run build && node --test test/write-safety.test.mjs test/cli.test.mjs test/e2e.test.mjs test/self-use.test.mjs.
    Exit: Satisfy the Stage 2 entry conditions in docs/process/self-use.md. Do not write an authoritative plan before this task completes.
  duration 2p
  status done
  priority 100
  requires:
    DEVELOPERS 1
    REVIEWERS 1
    CLI_SURFACE 1
    FILESYSTEM_WRITE 1

task ADVANCE_PLANNER SAFE_WRITE_READY -> ADVANCE_PLANNER_READY:
  title "Implement the join-preserving advance planner"
  description |
    Create: src/mutation/advance.ts and test/advance.test.mjs.
    Accept: Return the canonical keep/remove set, partial-join conditions, matching effective reached and ready sets before and after, and idempotence as a pure MutationResult.
    Test: npm run build && node --test test/advance.test.mjs test/analysis.test.mjs test/next.test.mjs.
    Parallel: File ownership permits this to run with post-safe-write Mermaid work, subject to the macro resource schedule.
  duration 4p
  status done
  priority 100
  requires:
    DEVELOPERS 1

task ADVANCE_CLI_ACCEPTANCE ADVANCE_PLANNER_READY -> OPERATIONS_READY:
  title "Accept dag advance through the safe-write path"
  description |
    Modify: src/cli.ts, src/index.ts, test/cli.test.mjs, test/e2e.test.mjs, and test/self-use.test.mjs.
    Accept: Verify the default preview, --diff, --write, advance-specific JSON, removed-entity lists, an empty diff on repetition, and the partial-join fixture.
    Test: npm run build && node --test test/advance.test.mjs test/cli.test.mjs test/e2e.test.mjs test/self-use.test.mjs.
    Exit: Satisfy the Stage 3 entry conditions in docs/process/self-use.md. Do not advance an authoritative plan before this task completes.
  duration 2p
  status done
  priority 100
  requires:
    DEVELOPERS 1
    REVIEWERS 1
    CLI_SURFACE 1
    FILESYSTEM_WRITE 1

milestone PROJECT_METADATA_CLI_READY:
  title "Project metadata CLI accepted"

task PROJECT_METADATA_CLI OPERATIONS_READY -> PROJECT_METADATA_CLI_READY:
  title "Make project metadata readable and editable through the CLI"
  description "Create: src/application/project.ts, src/mutation/project.ts, and test/project-metadata.test.mjs. Modify: requirements, mutation and interface specifications, basic design, CLI, public API, help, package smoke, and the AI workflow. Accept: Return every project metadata field, including velocity, through project show text/JSON; connect project set to preview-first safe write and atomic batch. Test: Run the narrow Core/CLI/E2E checks, then npm run check and git diff --check."
  duration 5p
  status done
  priority 100
  requires:
    DEVELOPERS 1
    REVIEWERS 1
    CLI_SURFACE 1
